#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:64
msgid ""
"Mattermost renders the template with your current context (channel, team,"
" user, time, selected agent) and inserts the result into your draft. If "
"you're not in a direct message with a bot, Mattermost also prepends the "
"selected agent's `@mention` so the agent will respond in-thread when you "
"post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:66
msgid ""
"You can review and edit the rendered draft before sending it like any "
"other message."
