#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:168
msgid "Limits and gotchas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:170
msgid "**Title length.** Prompt titles are limited to 64 characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:171
msgid ""
"**Required fields.** Both **Action Title** and **System Prompt** are "
"required. **Brief Description** and **Visibility** default to private if "
"you leave them alone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:172
msgid ""
"**Variable scope.** The variables listed in [Template variables"
"](#template-variables) are the only ones available — Custom Prompt "
"templates can't reference arbitrary fields. Variables that aren't "
"available in the current context render as empty text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:173
msgid ""
"**Per-user pins.** Pinning is per-user. Pinning a public prompt that "
"someone else owns pins it only for you — it doesn't affect other users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:174
msgid ""
"**Pinned-button posts are immediate.** Selecting a pinned prompt in the "
"**Agents** pane sends the rendered message right away. Use the composer "
"flow if you want to edit before sending."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:175
msgid ""
"**Editing other people's prompts.** Public prompts you didn't create open"
" read-only. Ask the prompt's creator to make changes, or copy the "
"template into a new prompt of your own."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:176
msgid ""
"**Deletion is soft.** Deleting a prompt removes it from listings and "
"unpins it for everyone, but only the creator can delete a prompt they "
"own."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:177
msgid ""
"**System Prompt length.** No explicit character limit is enforced by "
"Agents. The practical ceiling is the HTTP request body limit configured "
"for your Mattermost server (typically several megabytes). Note that very "
"long prompts may reduce the context window available for the agent's "
"response."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/custom_prompts.md:178
msgid ""
"**Render uses the agent selected when you click.** After the prompt is "
"rendered and inserted into the draft, the @mention is already in the "
"text. If you want to target a different agent, edit the @mention manually"
" before posting."
msgstr ""

